	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Message: Actor to Actor

Launch Nested Actor Msg is a private message of the Actor Framework. Unlike most message classes, it does not have a member VI for sending the message. The send for this message is instead a member of Actor.lvclass. For further information, please read the help for &lt;b&gt;Actor.lvclass:Send Launch Nested Actor Msg.vi&lt;/b&gt;.</Property>
